; Test 01 (T t08_tokquirk): round trip - load, SAVE over the file (file requester
; prefilled with the loaded path/name), QUIT.  Compared: saved file (= the
; original, @roundtrip), .bak (= the original), .xtra, .info, dump, requesters.
; @source T t08_tokquirk
; @roundtrip
; @est 3
; @expect exists t08_tokquirk.bb2.info
; @expect exists t08_tokquirk.bb2.xtra
timeout 10
wait req "OKEE DOKEE"
gad 1
wait screen
dump start
menu 0 2
wait freq "Name to save file as"
freq ok
wait screen
dump saved
menu 0 9
wait exit
